; Rule variations of the Grand Slam kind (spec §6.2, §6.3): eight ends, each team may blank only once
; (a second blank by the hammer team passes the hammer), and a game tied after eight ends is decided
; by a draw-to-the-button shootout instead of an extra end. Everything is fictional.
; Under these rules the hammer can move differently from the defaults, so every end states hammer=.
